    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yozefu tito lek pa Farawo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen ma oro ario gipi, Farawo oleko nike go oyido ocungo cegin gi malawa Nayil ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka neni, dhok abirio ma ragaŋ ma joleny jowok i malawa Nayil camo lum midole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka panen, dhok abirio man ma moso aka jomok, jowok wok i malawa Nayil, aka jocungo cegin gi dhok meca mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka dhok ma moso aka jomok jocamo dhok ma ragaŋ ma joleny. Aka Farawo ocew. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doko nindo okwalo go aka doko oleko. Aka panen, withi ŋano abirio, ma jopoŋ aka jocek oyido jodongo i kanja acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka neni, withi ŋano abirio man jowok, mathindho aka jothwo gi koyo mar'abar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka withi ŋano mathindho jomwonyo woko withi ŋano ma jopoŋ. Farawo ocew, aka neni oyido obedo lek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 2:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno odikin go oyido rembo, aka ooro wolwoŋi rigo jothieth ma Misir gi jorieko je. Farawo owaco rijo lek pere, to ngoye ŋat'onyalo tito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo jatel pa jotimi vini owaco ri Farawo ni, “Apoyo komo paran konon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo imako nge gi ŋecin perin, t'iketho an gi jatel pa jotedi mugat i jiera i ot pa jotel pa jokur, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waleko wor acel, aka kisi lek oyido nitie gi dwoŋ mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jayuda majayac oyido nitie kenyo gi wan, ŋeca pa jatel pa jokur. Aka munyo wawaco rigo, otito lek mawan, to tito ri kisi nyatoro lek pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka paka go otito riwan, ameno apaka obedo. Idwokan i kabedo paran, t'iŋawo jatel pa jotedi mugat.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farawo ooro to lwoŋo Yozefu, aka okeli go piyo wok i jiera. Munyo go otieko lielirok to wiro nangin pere, obino ruwaŋ kere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Farawo owaco rigo ni, “Aleko, aka ongoye ŋata nyalo tito, t'awinjo iwaco ni k'iwinjo lek inyalo tito.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu odwoko Farawo ni, “K'obedo an; Were bino miyo tito maber.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Farawo owaco ri Yozefu ni, “Neni, i lek paran oyido acungo cegin gi thengi malawa Nayil ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka dhok abirio ma ragaŋ ma joleny jowok i Nayil camo lum midole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka dhok abirio man ma moso aka jomok. Jobedo dhok mareco swa kwoŋ dhok m'atieko neno kamoro je i Misir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhok ma moso jocamo dhok ma ragaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ngoye ŋat'oyido oŋey rupiri oyido fodi joreco paka i cakirok. Kenyo acew. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An bende aneno i lek paran withi ŋano abirio jodongo i kanja acel m'oyido jopoŋ aka jocek, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi withi ŋano abirio ma jothwo aka thindho aka koyo mar'abar owaŋo jo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka ithe abirio mathindho jomwonyo woko ithe abirio ma jopoŋ. Aka awaco ri jothieth paran, to ngoye ŋat'oyido nyalo tito ran.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu owaco ri Farawo ni, “Lek ario jonyutho gimoro acel. Were omenyo rin gima go cegin timo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhok abirio ma ragaŋ meno oro abirio, aka withi ŋano abirio ma jopoŋ meno oro abirio. Jonyutho dwoŋ acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhok abirio ma moso ma jowok rumacen kodi withi ŋano mathindho ma koyo mar'abar owaŋo jobedo oro abirio ma kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obedo paka awaco ri Farawo, Were onyutho Farawo gima go cegin timo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bino bedo oro abirio ma dito i lowo ma Misir gipi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka rumacen, bino bedo oro abirio ma kec, ma k'opoy oro ma dito je i lowo ma Misir. Kec bino kisika woko lowo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka dito k'oŋeyere ro kec ma bino luwo rupiri bino bedo makec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiluda ma lek perin nyutho ni gime Were am'oketho, aka Were bino ketho i kare macegin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onyo riameno weyi Farawo woyeri jacwo mariek aka ma neno yuwaŋe to ketho go kuro Misir gipi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi Farawo bende woyeri jodhum man kwanyo acel wiy abic ma cemo ma lowo ma Misir i ndir ma oro abirio ma dito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi jowocoki cemo je ma oro abirio maber ma bino, aka miy jo meni ma kano ŋano i tindin madongo to jokuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cemo no bino bedo dero ri piny i oro abirio ma kec ma kidho bino i Misir ŋey ji jokiri joriy kec.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iketho Yozefu paka gavana ma Misir",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rieko me oneno maber ri Farawo gi jodhum pere ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Farawo owaco ri jodhum pere ni, “Wakibino nwaŋo jacwo maber loyo Yozefu, jacwo ma cuny pa Were nitie i go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Farawo owaco ri Yozefu ni, “Paka Were otieko nyuthin gime je, ongoye ŋati ma neno yuwaŋe aka riek paka in. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alakethin dhumo piny paran, aka ji je jolawinjo cik perin. Dwoŋ perin bino bedo mar'ario nyaka ri an.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Farawo owaco ri Yozefu ni, “Neni, atieko kethin dhumo lowo ma Misir je.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.5.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 5:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Farawo okwanyo peta pere ma oro ma ketho gine cinge i ndiko wok i lwet cinge, aka oketho i lwet cingi Yozefu. Oruko rigo nangin mafoth, aka oruko rigo thiwino ma zahabu i ŋute. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo go gweyo cawila pere mar'ario aka jokur pere jokadho yuwiy go ka joywak ni, “Tim yo! Tim yo!” Aka ameno okethi Yozefu gavana ma Misir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kiri Farawo owaco rigo ni, “Abedo Farawo, aka m'ongoye yerok perin ongoye ŋata bino tiŋo cinge kosa tiende i lowo ma Misir.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Farawo ocwoko nyingi Yozefu ni Zafenath Paneya to miyo go dhako m'ilwoŋo ni Asenath",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41:45",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Zafenath Paneya",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nyutho ni werin jowaco ni ŋata nitie gi nyinge me bino kwo.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Asenath",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nyutho ni apa were madhako",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nyar Potifera jacway ri Were i wi migam ma Oni. Ameno Yozefu owotho i lowo ma Misir gipi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu oyido jaoro piero adek munyo ocako tic ri Farawo kere ma Misir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndir ma oro abirio ma dito lowo onywolo cemo gibe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Yozefu ocoko cemo je to kano i kisi tindin madongo. I kisi tindi go okano cemo ma ndelin m'othoko go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido nitie ŋano madit ma cale kwoyo ma nam, aka Yozefu oweyo kiri kipima rupiri oyido kipimere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafodi oro ma kec k'otundo, Yozefu onwaŋo wote ario, ma Asenath nyar Potifera onywolo rigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu olwoŋo wode makayo ni Manase rupiri owaco ni, “Were omiyo wiyan wil gi kidamba paran gi ot pa baba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka nyingi mar'ario olwoŋo ni Efrayim to waco ni, “Were omiyan nyithindho i lowo ma candirok paran.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oro abirio ma dito m'obedo i lowo ma Misir otundo i gike, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 7:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka oro abirio ma kec ocako bino paka Yozefu oyido owaco. Kec oyido nitie i kisi piny, to cemo oyido nitie i Misir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 2:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Jomisir jocako winjo kec, joywak ri Farawo ri cemo aka Farawo owaco rijo ni, “Kidhi win bongi Yozefu aka gima go owaci, tim win.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno munyo kec olak i piny gibe, Yozefu oyawo dere aka otana gi Jomisir rupiri kec oyido olak i piny Misir paka rom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kiri, piny gibe jobino Misir bongi Yozefu nyewo ŋano rupiri kec oyido gway kisi kamoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
